# OS generated files #
.DS_Store*
Thumbs.db
# The blanket `.*` on line 1 swallows every dotfile, including project configuration that
# belongs in the repository. Anything already committed stays tracked, which is why the gap
# is easy to miss: a NEW workflow or ruleset is simply dropped by `git add -A`, in silence.
# Re-include the ones that are part of the project.
!.gitignore
!.htaccess
!.gitkeep
!.editorconfig
!.github/
!.php-cs-fixer.php
!.gitattributes

# Claude Code working directory — stays out of a public repo: it holds internal
# brainstorming, task notes and local permissions. CLAUDE.md itself is tracked:
# it is technical documentation of the SDK, and AGENTS.md points at it.
.claude/
.claude*

# Security - Prevent sensitive data commits
# Build and cache files (may contain sensitive data)
/build/
phpstan-result-cache.php
*.cache

# Environment and config files
*.env*
config.local.php
settings.local.json

# Test files with real data
**/test-data/
**/*real*.json

# Internal reports and audit documents
AUDIT_REPORT.md
*_REPORT.md
**/audit/
**/internal/
